{"_type":"issue","id":"cd-e17.12","title":"Off-device art preview / review gate","description":"Enlarged on-screen review of candidate sheets before anything is loaded onto the PicoSystem. build_tiles.py --preview emits: (1) 8x contact-sheet PNGs per sheet into Chapter_7/doc/preview/ (committed, diffable history), with tile-index labels + master palette strip; (2) an HTML review artifact with a zoom toggle (2x/4x/8x/12x), image-rendering:pixelated, each sheet on both dark and light backgrounds. Scale rationale: 2x ~= actual PicoSystem physical size on a ~109ppi monitor, 8x is the working size for judging a single tile, 10-16x for pixel-level dithering inspection. This is the off-device counterpart to cd-e17.10 (on-device verification) and runs each candidate/review/refine round.","design":"Preview code lives in build_tiles.py (cd-e17.4 owns the --preview emitter), desktop-only Pillow, not copied to CIRCUITPY. Contact sheets committed as PNG; HTML artifact regenerated per round.","notes":"Emitter BUILT as part of cd-e17.4: build_tiles.py --preview writes doc/preview/{terrain,creatures,heroes,objects}.png (8x labelled contact sheets, committed) + doc/preview/tiles.html (zoom 2/4/8/12x, light/dark bg, image-rendering:pixelated, sheet PNG embedded once per sheet). Verified via headless Chrome. This bead stays open as the recurring review-gate process run each candidate round.","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"chris.j.daly@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-08-28T06:01:37Z","created_by":"Chris Daly","updated_at":"2026-08-28T06:37:32Z","labels":["ch7"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"cd-e17.12","depends_on_id":"cd-e17","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-08-27T23:01:36Z","created_by":"Chris Daly","metadata":"{}"},{"issue_id":"cd-e17.12","depends_on_id":"cd-e17.4","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-08-27T23:01:40Z","created_by":"Chris Daly","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":1,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
