{"_type":"issue","id":"cd-e17.2","title":"Gather \u0026 catalogue reference art","description":"CC0 sets on hand: 0x72 DungeonTileset v4, DungeonTileset II, Industrial, Project Utumno. Find additional CC0/CC-BY top-down roguelike art worth referencing. Note licenses. Map which references inform terrain / heroes / monsters / objects.","notes":"Catalogue written to Chapter_7/doc/REFERENCES.md. Primaries: Project Utumno (CC0, 32x32, true overhead - terrain/monsters/items/heroes) + 0x72 v4 (CC0, 16x16 - items/palette/sprite style). Secondary: 0x72 II (creature designs + anim cadence; tiles_list_v1 is a machine-readable map). Skip: Industrial (sci-fi/mono), MedievalFantasy (side-view, license unclear), Adafruit sheets. Gaps: overhead 16x16 wall-tops + stairs (hand-author/procedural), 32-color master palette (cd-e17.3). Kenney packs + DB32 noted as gap-fillers if needed.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"chris.j.daly@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-08-27T07:14:31Z","created_by":"Chris Daly","updated_at":"2026-08-27T07:51:45Z","started_at":"2026-08-27T07:49:27Z","closed_at":"2026-08-27T07:51:45Z","close_reason":"Reference catalogue complete: Chapter_7/doc/REFERENCES.md","labels":["ch7"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"cd-e17.2","depends_on_id":"cd-e17","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-08-27T00:14:30Z","created_by":"Chris Daly","metadata":"{}"},{"issue_id":"cd-e17.2","depends_on_id":"cd-e17.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-08-27T00:14:38Z","created_by":"Chris Daly","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":1,"dependent_count":1,"comment_count":0}
